WEBVTT

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.850
Where are you headed

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:22.820
Boat of sincerity

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:31.290
With your flag of burning ambition raised?

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:34.260
Hakuoki: A Memory of Snow Flowers

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:42.500
If you are going to simply force your way forward

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:49.650
As if fighting against the fierce river currents

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.480
I want to accompany you

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:57.720
Even if the way is unclear

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:05.090
I believe in what lays beyond the torrents yonder

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:09.070
When you wander through the long night

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:13.700
Of spiritual darkness

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:17.740
I want to strike a small light for you

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:22.910
With my own little hands

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.180
Where are you headed

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:28.080
O blue ship

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:31.890
You face an indiscernible tomorrow

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:35.790
As you risk everything, as you risk your life

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:42.030
In search of the distant arcadia

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:53.550
Episode 5
The Winds of Fate

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:57.980
December 1866

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.370
Sumi Inn

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:33.700
January 1867

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:11.450
Saigo no ichi peeji
If we could greet

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:19.160
Issho ni mukaeraretara
The final page together

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:24.700
Yasashii akari ga
A gentle light might

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:27.860
Sashi komu deshou
Shine down upon us

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:38.940
Inochi no hajimari wa ai ni michi afurete
The beginning of our lives was filled with love

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:45.450
Kagayaki wo tsunagi awasu you ni
As we link our radiance together just like

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:51.730
Yorokobi no uta katari tsuide yuku tomoshibi
One passes down the light through a song of happiness

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:54.630
Tatakai iki nuki
Survive the battles

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:59.330
Hikari wo sagashinagara
As you search for the light

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:07.040
Kagayaku yozora ni ukabu seiza miagete
Look to the constellations floating in the shining night sky

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:13.580
Omoidasu utsukushiki hibi yo
And remember, O beautiful days

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:16.820
Chiisa na hoshikuzu
The tiny stardust

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:20.320
Tsuioku no kanata
Deep in your memories

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:25.730
Itsu made mo tomo ni ari tsuzukeru
We will be together for all time

00:22:25.730 --> 00:22:32.930
Tsuki hi wa mujou ni asu wo nuri kaenagara
The sun and moon mercilessly repaint the new day

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:39.470
Subete ubai satte iku no darou
Will they steal everything from us?

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:45.710
Sono toki ga kite mo kono te wo hanasazu
Even should that time come, I will not let go of this hand

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:51.810
Soba ni iru to chikau yo
I swear that I will be with you

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:59.160
Hoshi ga matataku kagiri
For as long as the star twinkle

00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:14.900
Hakuoki: A Memozy of Snow Flowezs

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:14.900
The End
